      "text": "PROTO-MODERNISM (1890–1919)\n  Adolf Loos (Vienna, 1870–1933)\n    \"Ornament and Crime\" (1908 lecture, 1913 essay)\n    Raumplan (space plan): interlocking volumes at different levels\n    Goldman & Salatsch Building, Vienna (1910–1911): clean facade\n  Peter Behrens (Berlin, 1868–1940)\n    AEG Turbine Factory (1909): industrial aesthetic as architecture\n    Employed: Gropius, Mies, Le Corbusier (at different times)"
